OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright and breezy with
OL,6,Foccasional showers in the morning,
OL,7,Fespecially for Perthshire where it
OL,8,Fwill be cloudier at times, mostly dry
OL,9,Ftowards Dundee and St Andrews. Fresh
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining windy and some
OL,13,Fshowers continuing to affect
OL,14,FPerthshire and Central towards the
OL,15,FFife Coast will have clear spells,
OL,16,Ffeeling quite chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
